src/components/contact-form.tsx:28-29:
```
window.location.href = `mailto:${t('email')}?subject=...&body=...`;
setSent(true);
```
The assignment is fire-and-forget: if no protocol handler is registered for mailto (a clean Safari or Chrome profile, a kiosk, a review device), the browser silently ignores it and `setSent(true)` still runs, rendering the green confirmation from en.json:372 "Thanks — we will get back to you soon." / vi.json:372 at contact-form.tsx:71-73. There is no API route anywhere in src/app to fall back to.
